{%- comment -%}
  ZNow same-day pincodes - a pincode the shopper TYPES (e.g. the product
  page's delivery check) gets ZNow when it is listed here. A shopper who
  shares their location is judged by assets/znow-area.json instead, which
  covers the same five districts.

  Edit freely: pincodes are separated by spaces, commas or new lines, and the
  groups are only for reading - add or remove a pincode anywhere.

  Source: India Post's pincode directory (api.postalpincode.in), October
  2026 - every pincode whose post offices sit in Delhi, Gurugram, Faridabad,
  Gautam Buddha Nagar or Ghaziabad district. 203141 203155 203201 203202 203203 are shared
  between Gautam Buddha Nagar and Bulandshahr and are included.
{%- endcomment -%}

